{"answer_text":"\"Free\" plans differ a lot in contact limits and locked features. The ones that stay useful without paying:\n\n### Top picks\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Essentials** — the safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace.\n2. **Pipewell Go** — easy to adopt, but email features cost extra.\n3. **Sheetly** — spreadsheet-based CRM templates — free and familiar, but they break down past a few hundred contacts.\n\n**Bottom line:** Start with Northwind CRM if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Pipewell if you expect to need deeper reporting.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-5109-753b-931f-724522aefcb8","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0109,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:25.950Z","engine":"chatgpt","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["free crm limits comparison"],"latency_ms":7490,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[128,141],[446,459]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[236,244],[502,510]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889f843f0cde","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Sheetly","name_text":"Sheetly","offsets":[[303,310]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."}],"model"